"},{"name":"Honesty","active":false,"tooltip":"Must speak with honesty and clarity (Negative)"},{"name":"Slow","active":false,"tooltip":"Lower move by an amount"},{"name":"Silenced","active":false,"tooltip":"Cannot Talk nor Cast Spells (Negative)"},{"name":"Enraged","active":false,"tooltip":"+5 dmg dealt, attack the nearest creature regardless if friend or foe at the start of your turn, (Negative)"},{"name":"Shocked","active":false,"tooltip":"If damage is taken while this is in effect become stunned. This stun ignores stun immunity. (Negative)"},{"name":"Freeze","active":false,"tooltip":"Reduce move in half and -20 Avo. If hit with fire of any kind. Remove this effect. (Negative)"},{"name":"Cursed","active":false,"tooltip":"Reduce Max Hp by 5% and Res by 3 (5 stacks max). When restored outside of turn expiration the affected creature heals the reduced amount. (Negative)","effects":[],"id":"97b643f8-3e0b-4427-aba0-69d1b988d360"},{"name":"Taunting","active":false,"tooltip":"Force attacks to this creature if an enemy can for a number of combats or turns"},{"name":"Immobilized","active":false,"tooltip":"Reduce Move and Avo to 0. (Negative)","effects":[{"id":"aedc112b-60fe-4cff-9aa6-e5357f1f8767","amount":-999,"target":{"kind":"widget","widgetId":"ba770d7c-e8d6-4fd8-9c3d-ff48542a701c","field":"value","collection":"displayNumbers","entryId":"16c027c1-1d99-4d1c-a3a2-e73fea442c62"},"targetName":"Main - Special Stats - AVO - Value"},{"id":"67dc50b4-a4e8-46e6-ace0-ccaee8f48ef5","amount":-999,"target":{"kind":"widget","widgetId":"ba770d7c-e8d6-4fd8-9c3d-ff48542a701c","field":"value","collection":"displayNumbers","entryId":"3b9c086e-6578-476d-a352-e09d51964a07"},"targetName":"Main - Special Stats - MOVE - Value"}],"id":"b81206f0-7567-43ce-b564-f0cdbc96953d"},{"name":"Heroism","active":false,"tooltip":"Gain +10Hit/Avo/Dodge/Crit. Must attack an enemy in range every turn or lose the status. Can consume Heroism to make an attack that has range 5-10ft and deals 3d6 + Str/4 or Mag/4